    {
      "q": "How does Math 2048 work?",
      "a": "The active math operation cycles between Addition (+), Subtraction (-), and Multiplication (×). Merging two tiles applies the current operation to calculate the new tile value!"
    },
    {
      "q": "What happens in Subtraction mode?",
      "a": "When tiles merge in Subtraction mode, the larger tile subtracts the smaller (or matching tiles become a new baseline 2), preventing dead ends."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is Math 2048 suitable for classrooms?",
      "a": "Yes! Teachers and students love Math 2048 for rapid mental arithmetic and strategic thinking."
    }
